# Poly Planet environment variables
#
# The current app uses only free, key-less public APIs (Open-Meteo + Wikipedia),
# so NO variables are required to run it. This file documents what you might add
# as the project grows.
#
# Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the client. Never put secret
# keys here for client-side use — route those through a serverless function.

# Example: if you later add a keyed provider through a proxy function,
# the *public* base URL of that proxy could live here:
# VITE_API_PROXY_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app/api
